WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.301 --> 00:00:03.803
-White House Press Secretary
Sarah Huckabee Sanders

00:00:03.803 --> 00:00:06.472
has been holding a lot
of press briefings lately,

00:00:06.472 --> 00:00:08.508
but I don't think --
I personally don't think

00:00:08.508 --> 00:00:11.444
all the questions we need
answered have been asked.

00:00:11.444 --> 00:00:13.880
So we decided to hold another
one right here, right now.

00:00:13.880 --> 00:00:15.614
That's right --
Sarah Huckabee Sanders

00:00:15.614 --> 00:00:18.418
and the Late Night Press Corps
are here in our studio

00:00:18.418 --> 00:00:20.387
and ready to go.
So without further ado,

00:00:20.387 --> 00:00:23.322
it's time for the "Late Night"
White House Press Briefing.

00:00:23.322 --> 00:00:25.491
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:25.491 --> 00:00:31.164 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:31.164 --> 00:00:33.499
-Sarah, yes, Sarah, over here!

00:00:33.499 --> 00:00:36.069
Sarah! Sarah! Sarah, over here.

00:00:36.069 --> 00:00:38.604
Yes, thank you, Seth Meyers,
"Late Night With Seth Meyers."

00:00:38.604 --> 00:00:40.706
Secretary Sanders, I have
a couple of questions

00:00:40.706 --> 00:00:42.408
I'd like to ask if you
if you don't mind.

00:00:42.408 --> 00:00:46.278
Why have Donald and Melania
looked so unhappy

00:00:46.278 --> 00:00:47.413
since the election?

00:00:47.413 --> 00:00:49.048
-They didn't want to win.

00:00:49.048 --> 00:00:51.851
[ Laughter ]

00:00:51.851 --> 00:00:55.288
-When was the last time
President Trump saw his feet?

00:00:55.288 --> 00:00:56.589
-The days of Ronald Reagan.

00:00:56.589 --> 00:00:59.525
[ Laughter ]

00:00:59.525 --> 00:01:02.027
-Where's Sean Spicer working
nowadays?

00:01:02.027 --> 00:01:05.498
-At the local Walmart.

00:01:05.498 --> 00:01:08.168
-What's your favorite part
of this job?

00:01:08.168 --> 00:01:10.503
-Purposely misleading
the American people.

00:01:10.503 --> 00:01:13.139
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:13.139 --> 00:01:18.077
Very well. Write that down.

00:01:18.077 --> 00:01:21.413
-What do Eric and Donald Jr.
do at the White House?

00:01:21.413 --> 00:01:23.583
-Repeatedly beg for money.

00:01:23.583 --> 00:01:26.185
[ Laughter ]

00:01:26.185 --> 00:01:28.420
-What would be
a horrible premise

00:01:28.420 --> 00:01:30.255
for a "Thelma &amp; Louise" sequel?

00:01:30.255 --> 00:01:31.891
-First Lady Melania Trump

00:01:31.891 --> 00:01:35.428
and Second Lady Karen Pence
will travel to Texas.

00:01:35.428 --> 00:01:36.863
-Ugh.

00:01:36.863 --> 00:01:37.964
[ Laughter ]

00:01:37.964 --> 00:01:39.665
It's been reported
that the President

00:01:39.665 --> 00:01:41.100
eats a lot of McDonald's.

00:01:41.100 --> 00:01:45.071
if true, he must leave behind
a pretty devastating fart cloud.

00:01:45.071 --> 00:01:47.373
-I've walked through
that a couple of times now.

00:01:47.373 --> 00:01:51.744
[ Laughter ]

00:01:51.744 --> 00:01:54.847
-My sympathies.

00:01:54.847 --> 00:01:57.150
What's the most bonkers thing

00:01:57.150 --> 00:01:59.685
you've ever heard
Betsy DeVos say?

00:01:59.685 --> 00:02:02.455
-Tuesday was created in 2012.

00:02:02.455 --> 00:02:04.657
[ Laughter ]

00:02:04.657 --> 00:02:06.625
-What does Melania call
the first time

00:02:06.625 --> 00:02:07.993
she went out with Donald?

00:02:07.993 --> 00:02:09.729
-The day which will live
in infamy.

00:02:09.729 --> 00:02:11.097
[ Laughter ]

00:02:11.097 --> 00:02:13.933
-Hey, what's going on with
Eric's birthday party?

00:02:13.933 --> 00:02:15.568
-As of right now,

00:02:15.568 --> 00:02:17.703
that's not something
that's currently being planned

00:02:17.703 --> 00:02:20.506
and not something that
I'm aware is moving forward

00:02:20.506 --> 00:02:22.342
in any capacity.

00:02:22.342 --> 00:02:23.809
[ Laughter ]

00:02:23.809 --> 00:02:26.512
-What's Donald Trump's favorite
part about being president?

00:02:26.512 --> 00:02:28.281
-The corruption.

00:02:28.281 --> 00:02:31.851
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:36.122 --> 00:02:38.491
-I know he lost
his election in Alabama,

00:02:38.491 --> 00:02:41.060
but what are Judge Roy Moore's
preferences

00:02:41.060 --> 00:02:42.395
when it comes to dating?

00:02:42.395 --> 00:02:45.631
-15's better than 20,
20's better than 22.

00:02:45.631 --> 00:02:49.302
[ Audience groans ]

00:02:49.302 --> 00:02:51.871
-What were the results
of Trump's brain scan?

00:02:51.871 --> 00:02:53.640
-There's no gray area there.

00:02:53.640 --> 00:02:57.143
[ Laughter ]

00:02:57.143 --> 00:02:59.145
-Is it true --

00:02:59.145 --> 00:03:03.149
is it true that Trump
took a meeting

00:03:03.149 --> 00:03:06.685
with the heiress to the La-Z-Boy
recliner fortune?

00:03:06.685 --> 00:03:09.021
-I'm not aware if the President
spoke specifically

00:03:09.021 --> 00:03:11.090
with the chair woman.

00:03:11.090 --> 00:03:13.326
[ Laughter ]

00:03:13.326 --> 00:03:16.095
-Chair woman, you know?

00:03:16.095 --> 00:03:18.831
[ Laughter ]

00:03:18.831 --> 00:03:22.234
[ Applause ]

00:03:22.234 --> 00:03:24.637
[ Scoffs ]

00:03:24.637 --> 00:03:26.940
-Is it true that Eric
spray-painted a penis

00:03:26.940 --> 00:03:28.608
on the hood of
Robert Mueller's car?

00:03:28.608 --> 00:03:30.143
-That's exactly what he did.

00:03:30.143 --> 00:03:31.877
[ Laughter ]

00:03:31.877 --> 00:03:33.112
-Can you describe it?

00:03:33.112 --> 00:03:35.148
-That was pretty lengthy
and pretty detailed.

00:03:35.148 --> 00:03:36.549
[ Laughter ]

00:03:36.549 --> 00:03:39.485
-Hey, let's do the jingle
for Almond Joy and Mounds

00:03:39.485 --> 00:03:40.653
candy bars together.

00:03:40.653 --> 00:03:42.655
-Sometimes...
-♪ You feel like a nut ♪

00:03:42.655 --> 00:03:44.290
-And a lot of times you don't.

00:03:44.290 --> 00:03:45.658
[ Laughter ]

00:03:45.658 --> 00:03:47.226
-Thank you.
Thanks for doing this.

00:03:47.226 --> 00:03:50.263
That was a lot of fun.

00:03:50.263 --> 00:03:53.132
[ Laughter ]

00:03:53.132 --> 00:03:56.869
-What does Eric run into when
he's walking down the street?

00:03:56.869 --> 00:03:58.738
-Pole after pole after pole.

00:03:58.738 --> 00:04:00.539
[ Laughter ]

00:04:00.539 --> 00:04:03.042
-How often does President Trump
exercise?

00:04:03.042 --> 00:04:07.546
-10 separate times
over the last 20 years.

00:04:07.546 --> 00:04:09.748
-Does the President
believe in Satan?

00:04:09.748 --> 00:04:11.650
-The President
not only knows him,

00:04:11.650 --> 00:04:12.885
but has played golf with him.

00:04:12.885 --> 00:04:14.020
[ Audience groans ]

00:04:14.020 --> 00:04:15.188
-Well, looks like
we're out of time,

00:04:15.188 --> 00:04:16.656
so behalf on the rest
of the press corps,

00:04:16.656 --> 00:04:18.658
have a good night. We'll be
right back with James Franco.

00:04:18.658 --> 00:04:19.392
[ Cheers and applause ]

